const body = "<section class=\"hero wrap\"> <div class=\"shead reveal\"> <div class=\"label\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">// Services</span><span class=\"folio\">01</span></div> </div> <h1 class=\"h1 reveal d1\" style=\"max-width:16ch;margin-top:18px\">Web design and development, <span class=\"u-accent\">starting from strategy.</span></h1> <p class=\"lead reveal d2\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">Five ways I work with businesses and organisations. All of them start in the same place — understanding the problem first — and differ only in how far I go in executing it.</p> <div class=\"reveal d3\" style=\"margin-top:32px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap\"> <a href=\"https://wa.me/6285927277560?text=Hi!%20I'd%20like%20to%20work%20out%20which%20service%20fits%20my%20situation...\" class=\"btn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-wa=\"hero\" data-page=\"/en/services.html\"> Free Consultation<span class=\"arr\">↗</span> </a> <a href=\"/en/pricing\" class=\"btn ghost\">See pricing <span class=\"arr\">↗</span></a> </div> </section> <hr class=\"hair\" style=\"margin:0 var(--gut)\"> <section class=\"pad-sm wrap\"> <div class=\"shead reveal\"> <div class=\"label\"> <div> <span class=\"eyebrow\">// 02 — Choose</span> <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px;max-width:20ch\">Pick by the problem, not the label.</h2> <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px;max-width:62ch\">If you are unsure, take the free consultation and let me help you choose — including the possibility that I tell you none of these is what you need yet.</p> </div> <span class=\"folio\">02</span> </div> </div> <div class=\"svc-hub\"> <a class=\"svc-hub-card\" href=\"/en/services/wordpress-development\"> <span class=\"n\">/01 — WordPress Development</span> <h3>WordPress Development from Indonesia</h3> <p>Clean WordPress builds for international clients, from someone who has spent six years working across time zones and knows what actually goes wrong.</p> <span class=\"meta\">From IDR 5,000,000 (approx. USD 320)</span> <span class=\"open\">Read more ↗</span> </a><a class=\"svc-hub-card\" href=\"/en/services/company-profile-website\"> <span class=\"n\">/02 — Company Profile Website</span> <h3>Company Profile Websites</h3> <p>A website that makes people understand what you do in thirty seconds — and why it matters to them.</p> <span class=\"meta\">From IDR 5,000,000 (approx. USD 320)</span> <span class=\"open\">Read more ↗</span> </a><a class=\"svc-hub-card\" href=\"/en/services/ecommerce-website\"> <span class=\"n\">/03 — E-Commerce Website</span> <h3>E-Commerce Development</h3> <p>An online store that still makes sense when your catalogue grows from twenty products to two hundred.</p> <span class=\"meta\">From IDR 15,000,000 (approx. USD 950)</span> <span class=\"open\">Read more ↗</span> </a><a class=\"svc-hub-card\" href=\"/en/services/landing-page-design\"> <span class=\"n\">/04 — Landing Page</span> <h3>Landing Pages</h3> <p>A single page with one job: getting the right person to take one clear action.</p> <span class=\"meta\">By consultation</span> <span class=\"open\">Read more ↗</span> </a><a class=\"svc-hub-card\" href=\"/en/services/website-consulting-retainer\"> <span class=\"n\">/05 — Consulting Retainer</span> <h3>Website Consulting</h3> <p>For founders and teams making expensive digital decisions with nobody independent to test them against.</p> <span class=\"meta\">By consultation</span> <span class=\"open\">Read more ↗</span> </a> </div> </section> <hr class=\"hair\" style=\"margin:0 var(--gut)\"> <section class=\"pad-sm wrap\"> <div class=\"shead reveal\"> <div class=\"label\"> <div> <span class=\"eyebrow\">// 03 — How it runs</span> <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">One process, whichever service.</h2> <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:18px;max-width:62ch\">Every project moves through the same stages. You will always know where we are, what is next, and what I need from you.</p> </div> <span class=\"folio\">03</span> </div> </div> <div class=\"proc\"> <div class=\"proc-step reveal\"><div class=\"pn\">1.</div><h3>Discovery &amp; Diagnosis</h3><p>Understanding the business, the challenge, and the opportunity. You get clear scope, a timeline, and an honest read on what is realistic.</p></div> <div class=\"proc-step reveal d1\"><div class=\"pn\">2.</div><h3>Design &amp; Development</h3><p>Designing and building the solution. Regular updates, room for feedback, and no surprises at launch.</p></div> <div class=\"proc-step reveal d2\"><div class=\"pn\">3.</div><h3>Launch &amp; Growth</h3><p>Supporting long-term success after launch. A site that works on day one, and a plan for day one hundred.</p></div> <div class=\"proc-step reveal d3\"><div class=\"pn\">4.</div><h3>Timeline Transparency</h3><p>Projects typically run 4–12 weeks depending on complexity. No mystery, no moving targets.</p></div> </div> </section> <section class=\"cta-ink pad\"> <img class=\"bgimg\" src=\"/img/cta-bg.webp\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"> <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"position:relative\"> <span class=\"eyebrow reveal\">// Let's talk</span> <h2 class=\"h2 reveal d1\" style=\"margin:24px 0 36px\">Not sure which one you need?</h2> <div class=\"reveal d2\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/6285927277560?text=Hi!%20I'd%20like%20to%20work%20out%20which%20service%20fits%20my%20situation...\" class=\"btn on-ink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-wa=\"cta\" data-page=\"/en/services.html\"> Free Consultation<span class=\"arr\">↗</span> </a></div> </div> </section>";
